<title>USA: Wavetek Corp issues $85 mln in 10-year 144A notes.</title>
<headline>Wavetek Corp issues $85 mln in 10-year 144A notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144A debt issue from Wavetek Corp was priced in the U.S. high-yield bond market via Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities, dealers said.</p>
<p>Wavetek is a leading provider in the wireless and telecom sectors.</p>
<p>BORROWER WAVETEK CORPORATION</p>
<p>AMT  $85 MLN	   COUPON 10-1/8     MATURITY 6/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNRSSUB NOTES   ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 12/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B3	YIELD 10-1/8	PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-MINUS     SPREAD		CALLABLE NON CALL FIVE</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1675))</p>
